WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
Three, three million a month's rent

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:06,820
I have to pay him protection fees from time to time.

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,220
What is the difference between this and blackmail?

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,200
It seems that you are going to regret it.

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,000
Boss, it’s not me who regrets it

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
I'm really just a newly born three-S-level little weirdo.

7
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,200
If you don’t believe me, the poor Ding Dang Xiang, look at it

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,000
I'm so poor that I don't even have a bank plug.

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:29,200
Where do you get the money to pay the rent, boss?

10
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,400
Look at my poor character

11
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,600
Even if I live in your community
